# Arcane Adaptation's "The same is true for creature spells you control" works on the stack (CR 611.3a): with Merfolk chosen
# for both it and Door of Destinies ("Whenever you cast a spell of the chosen type, put a charge counter on this artifact"),
# Bot1's Llanowar Elves is a Merfolk spell as it is cast on turn 3 (CR 601.2i), so the Door triggers and gets a charge
# counter (CR 603.2). On the battlefield the Elves is a Merfolk too, and the Door's "Creatures you control of the chosen type
# get +1/+1 for each charge counter" makes it a 2/2. Without Arcane Adaptation an Elf spell would not trigger the Door.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Sol Ring
Arcane Adaptation
Door of Destinies
Llanowar Elves
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
